      "defect_description": "Both samples provided identical standard filenames causing hash collisions in bare-filename lookup. Furthermore, S2 was only hashed but its matrix was never parsed.",
      "fix_implementation": "1. Eliminated bare-filename fallback in _collect_manifest_checksums and check_downstream_consumed. All files are bound by resolved absolute paths and sample roles. 2. In multi-sample runs, every declared sample is independently and strictly parsed with _parse_10x_matrix_strict. 3. Downstream acceptance verifies each sample's parsed state, exact dimension match against its own upstream matrix, and triad checksums.",
      "verification_tests": [
